@startuml

title AI Comment Generation API

actor User

rectangle "FastAPI" as API
rectangle "Input Validation" as VALID
rectangle "Prompt Builder" as PROMPT
rectangle "Gemini LLM" as LLM
database "SQLite Database" as DB

User --> API : Post + Platform
API --> VALID : Validate
VALID --> PROMPT : Valid input
PROMPT --> LLM : Prompt
LLM --> API : Generated comment
API --> DB : Save comment
DB --> API : Comment history
API --> User : JSON response

@enduml